    "post_text": [
      "🌟 Get Ready for Thirsty Thursday at Booze Pops! 🌟\n\nJoin us this Thursday for a delightful treat! We’re serving up frozen cocktail refreshing popsicles, fun Jell-O shots, and delicious kids’ ice cream—perfect for cooling down on a hot day! Plus, enjoy a FREE bottle of water with every purchase at our trucks.\n\n📍 Find us at:\n\n • Downtown\n  \n               Folly Beach\n\n • Mount Pleasant\n\n • Neighborhood by request!\n\nDon’t miss out on the fun and flavors! 🍧🥤✨\n\n#BoozePops #ThirstyThursday #FrozenTreats #VeteranOwned #TasteTheFun"
    ],
